  "description": "ANSWER THE CALL\nFrom the edge of the unknown comes SIREN—a titanium speed machine built to lure your neighborhood Strava segments to their sudden death. Tuned for high performance and low fatigue, it’s nimble enough for race day and smooth enough to float over potholes on your off-season commute—everything a modern road bike should be. With clean lines, wide clearance, and instinctive handling, SIREN is built to disappear beneath you, so you can focus on the ride.\nEngineered around full electronic shifting and ENVE’s In-Route cockpit, SIREN is a study in uncompromising speed. Its double-butted titanium frame balances absolute stiffness with road-smoothing compliance, while clearance for 700 x 35mm tires ensures traction without sacrifice. A T47 bottom bracket and UDH dropouts future-proof the ride, ensuring nothing—mechanical or otherwise—interrupts its trajectory.",
